alert tcp 10.20.70.0/24 any -> !10.20.0.0/16 8443 (msg:"PURPLE R08 user zone to external 8443 (non-standard TLS)"; flow:to_server; flags:S,12; threshold:type limit, track by_src, count 1, seconds 3600; metadata:mitre_technique_id T1571, purple_round R08; classtype:policy-violation; sid:9608002; rev:1;)
# 대용량 업로드는 서명보다 eve flow 의 bytes_toserver 합계(집계)로 본다 — 참고용 stream_size 규칙
alert tcp 10.20.70.0/24 any -> !10.20.0.0/16 443 (msg:"PURPLE R08 large upload over TLS (>100MB, stream)"; flow:established,to_server; stream_size:client,>,100000000; metadata:mitre_technique_id T1567, purple_round R08; classtype:policy-violation; sid:9608003; rev:1;)
